'''Ball Weevil''' is the [[Omnitrix]]'s DNA sample of an [[Ball Weevil's Species|unknown species]] from an unknown planet.

==Appearance==
Ball Weevil is a small yellow insect-like alien with black eyes and green pupils. He has four stick legs and a beak along with a big antenna.

Ball Weevil wears the [[Omnitrix (Omniverse)|Omnitrix]] symbol on a green and white brace around his neck.

==Powers and Abilities==
<gallery type="slideshow" position="right">
SD1 (233).png|Plasma Ball Generation
SD1 (236).png|Matter Absorption (via Plasma Balls)
RoAE (128).png|Energy Absoprtion (via Plasma Balls)
RoE (390).png|Plasma Whip
RoAE (143).png|Plasma Imprisonment
WYWA (237).png|Enhanced Strength
RoE (483).png|Enhanced Durability
DepreyPresa1P398.png|Enhanced Jumping/Agility
WYWA (230).png|Enhanced Speed (via Plasma Balls)
DepreyPresa1P444.png|Small-Space Maneuvering
DepreyPresa1P445.png|Wall Scaling
DepreyPresa1P454.png|Bipedalism
</gallery>
Ball Weevil can spit round, green, sticky balls of plasma<ref>[[Rook Blonko]]</ref><ref name="WYWA">''[[While You Were Away]]''</ref>{{Refn|Alternate versions of Ball Weevil are shown generating plasma in different colors. For example, [[Weapon XI (Present)|17-year-old Mutant Kevin]]'s plasma is colored red.<ref>''[[Weapon XI: Part 2]]''</ref>|group = note}} that absorb matter or energy<ref>''[[The Rooters of All Evil]]''</ref> and explode upon impact, or whenever Ball Weevil wants it to.<ref name = "RoE">''[[Rules of Engagement]]''</ref> The size of these balls depends on how much matter they absorb. The bigger the ball he creates, the larger the explosion will be.

Ball Weevil's plasma balls can be in more shapes than just spheres. He can even spew out plasma in a controllable stream to act as a rope to tie up an enemy. The plasma is strong enough to momentarily hold a [[Tetramand (Classic)|Tetramand]].<ref name="RoE"/>

Ball Weevil seems to be pretty strong for his size, as shown when he stopped his giant plasma ball rolling at a high speed.<ref name="WYWA"/>

Ball Weevil seems to be decently durable for his size, being able to survive and stand up from his plasma ball explosions.<ref name="RoE"/>

Ball Weevil has enhanced agility and jumping; being able to roll on his plasma balls, do flips, scale on walls with ease, and jump to great heights.<ref name="OPaP1">''[[Of Predators and Prey: Part 1]]''</ref>

Ball Weevil's plasma balls are buoyant enough to float on water.{{Refn|[[:File:Ball Weevil's Plasma Can Float on Water.png]]|group = DJW}}

===Non-Canon Powers and Abilities===
====Galactic Champions====
Ball Weevil can poison others by scratching them with his claws and horn.

==Weaknesses==
<gallery type="slideshow">
DepreyPresa1P420.png|Ineffective Plasma Balls
DepreyPresa1P457.png|Vulnerability to Plasma
RoE (432).png|Trapped in Plasma
SD1 (248).png|Trapped by Terroranchula
</gallery>
Ball Weevil's plasma can be neutralized by webs from [[Terroranchula]]s.<ref name="OPaP1"/> It is also useless against a species capable of withstanding it, such as [[Arburian Pelarota (Classic)|Arburian Pelarotas]].{{Refn|[[:File:Cannonbolt Can Withstand Ball Weevil's Plasma.png]]|group = DJW}}

Ball Weevil can be hurt by his own plasma balls if they are reflected at him.<ref name="OPaP1"/> He can also get stuck in his own plasma.<ref name="RoE"/>

Ball Weevil's small size puts him at a disadvantage against larger opponents, such as Terroranchulas and he can be trapped in its web.<ref name="OPaP1"/><ref name="SP1" />  

==History==
===Omniverse===
*Ball Weevil first appeared in ''[[Of Predators and Prey: Part 1]]'', where he was defeated by [[Khyber]].{{Refn|Ball Weevil was never locked in the [[Omnitrix (Omniverse)|Omnitrix]].{{Refn|[[:File:New Aliens in OV Weren't Locked.png]]|group = DJW}}|group = note}}
*In ''[[Arrested Development]]'', 11-year-old Ben as Ball Weevil defeated [[Computron]]'s [[Computron's Minions|minions]].
*In ''[[Rules of Engagement]]'', Ball Weevil defeated [[Looma Red Wind|Princess Looma]] with [[Julie Yamamoto|Julie]]'s help.
*In ''[[Showdown: Part 1]]'', Ball Weevil battled [[Tyrannopede]] until she turned into [[Terroranchula (Transformation)|Terroranchula]] and trapped him.
*In ''[[While You Were Away]]'', Ball Weevil escaped the brainwashed [[Revonnahgander]]s.
*In ''[[Cough It Up]]'', Ball Weevil fought [[Sunder]] and was saved by [[Ken Tennyson (Original)|Spanner]].
*In ''[[The Rooters of All Evil]]'', Ball Weevil defeated [[Swift]] and [[Leander]].
*In ''[[Weapon XI: Part 2]]'', Ball Weevil defeated a [[Way Bad]].
*In ''[[The Most Dangerous Game Show]]'', Ball Weevil battled a [[Slammoid]].
*In ''[[A New Dawn]]'', Ball Weevil appeared for a short time when [[Ben Tennyson (Classic)|Ben]] was cycling through his aliens.

