==Etymology==
Ball Weevil's name is a combination of the words "ball" and "[[Wikipedia:Boll weevil|boll weevil]]".

==Trivia==
*[[Derrick J. Wyatt]] came up with and designed Ball Weevil before he worked on '''[[Ben 10: Omniverse (TV Series)|Omniverse]]'''; this included coming up with his powers.{{Refn|[[:File:Derrick Came Up With Ball Weevil.png]]|group = DJW}}{{Refn|[[:File:Gravattack Production.PNG]]|group = DJW|name = name}}
**Ball Weevil was named by [[Matt Wayne]].{{Refn|group = DJW|name = name}}
*Ball Weevil's design was inspired by the ''[[Wikipedia:Pokémon|Pokémon]]'' franchise.{{Refn|[[:File:Ball Weevil Inspired By Pokemon.png]]|group = DJW}}
*Ball Weevil's concept names were Turd Burglar{{Refn|[[:File:Turd Burglar Proof.PNG]]|group = DJW}} and Collectiball.{{Refn|[[:File:Stinkfly Slime Type.png]]|group = MW|name = link}}
**The latter name was changed when it was found that there was a product with the same name.{{Refn|group = MW|name = link}}{{Refn|[[:File:Collectiball Trademark Issue.png]]|group = MW}}
*Out of all the aliens who were introduced in '''Omniverse''', Ball Weevil is Matt Wayne and [[Joe Kelly]]'s favorite.{{Refn|[[:File:Matt Wayne's Favorite OV Alien.png]]|group = MW}}{{Refn|group = JK|https://twitter.com/yasinemiralkaya/status/1771639134660055254}}
*Ball Weevil's powers bear a resemblance to the Katamaris' from ''[[Wikipedia:Katamari Damacy|Katamari Damacy]]''.{{Refn|[[:File:Derrick Sketches.png]]|group = ca}}

